{title: Jugrafiya}
{artist: Ajay Atul Udit Narayan Shreya Ghoshal}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Jab se hua tere [Bm]nazdik hai,        [Em]Dil ke mohalle mein [Bm]sab thik hai,
[Em]Jab se hua tere [Bm]nazdik hai,        [Em]Dil ke mohalle mein [Bm]sab thik hai,
[G]Zara sa kitabon mein [D]kam dhyan hai,        Zayada [C]ere khyalon mein [B]hai,
[G]Tujhse jo milke ma [D]zaa hai,        Kaha wo ga [C]nit ke sawalon mein [B]hai
Kar ke [Em]gustakhiya,        [B]Maange na maafi [Em]yan,
Teri [C]chahat ne [Am]badla mere,        [C]Dil ka jugrafi [B]ya..
[Em]Cycle par leke jaaunga,        Samose garam khilaunga main,
Kar [Am]waada shanivaar ko..        Bhag [D]wan ke bharose, chhod ke samose,
[F]Bhul jaaaye sombar [B]ko..        [Em]Tere liye ghar se nikalti hoon,
Jab kehta hai milti hoon,        Ghar [Am]walon se chup ke kabhi,
Par [D]waah nahi hai meri,        Jyazdati hai teri,
[F]Kya samjh rakha hai pyaar [G]ko,        Tujhe kis tarah ba [D]taun main,
Kitna za [C]roori tera pyaar [Em]hai, [B],        [G]Mere adhiyaare se [D]jivan mein,
Tu hi sa [C]fedi ki chakaar [B]hai,        Kar ke gustakhi [Em]ya,
[B]Maange na maafi [Em]yan,        Teri [C]chahat ne [Am]badla mere,
[C]Dil ka jugraa [B]fiya.. [Em]
